{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1534748-idea-for-new-vector-power","id":1534748,"title":"Idea for new Vector power?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-04-25T21:52:54-07:00","id":1534748,"title":"Idea for new Vector power?","content":"I really like the power you get from the Vector, but I think there isn't enough of it, does anyone have any idea or suggestion on how to make new power while still fit the theme of that vector?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-26T00:26:46-07:00","id":1534751,"title":"","content":"Vectors are based on methods used to fight a plague, revolving around a one word key concept (Authority, ecc..)<br /> If you want to create a new Vector you can think first to a new keyword, like Isolation, and then expand the concept.<br /> If you want to create alternative levels of existing Vectors, try to think about a different approach in fighting a plague that fit the same keyword","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-26T00:57:36-07:00","id":1534752,"title":"","content":"I would like to create alternative level of existing Vector, but I struggling on how it would be balance within the same tier of the official Vector power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-27T02:48:45-07:00","id":1534799,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1534748-idea-for-new-vector-power?p=1534752#post1534752\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would like to create alternative level of existing Vector, but I struggling on how it would be balance within the same tier of the official Vector power.</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably i would go with trying to copy the same level power, and then adding a twist.<br /> For example you could take Plutomancy and substitute monetary resource with &quot;human resources&quot; (levels of staff, retainer, ecc..)<br /> it s not an easy task, especially in regard of Edges, but it becomes easier if you focus on results first, and then you elaborate on the way for obtaining them","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-30T19:08:33-07:00","id":1534975,"title":"","content":"As always, the best rule to follow is that it shouldn't be neither obviously better, nor obviously worse.<br /> <br /> Balance is a relative thing. Like, literally. Just compare the new power with the existing one and think: do they each stand on their own merits?<br /> <br /> If one is obviously a better choice, the other standing only by virtue of being cool or not even that, then it is back to the drawing board.<br /> <br /> Oh, and remember to consider the whole build, in this case, an actual character having the full Vector.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}